{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mei.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "有人撞到了你，然后笑了",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mei.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mei.first",
    "idolId": "mei",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……想也没用！总之到处走走——哇！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉！你受伤了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "啊，没事没事～うち才是，走神了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好亮的笑……）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "诶？你是星探吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？为什么这么问？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "因为你刚才在看人家的脸看了好久嘛～",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊、不是，不是那种意思……其实我是做偶像制作人的。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "哦～！偶像！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "うち，对偶像不太了解诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那我问一下，你有兴趣试试当偶像吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "うち？当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。偶像有可爱的类型，也有帅气的类型……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "像你这样开朗的性格，一定会被粉丝喜欢的。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……真的？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的。要不要试试？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "嗯——……那，试试也行吧？反正也挺好玩的。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢！今后请多指教！对了，能告诉我你的名字吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "うち、和泉愛依～请多指教哦，大哥……不对，是制作人♪"
      }
    }
  },
